   {q:"What does the woman imply when she says \"'proves' was a strong word\"?", o:["She now agrees that their wording overstated the result","She thinks the TA misunderstood the report","She wants to repeat the experiment immediately","She believes five trials were enough"], a:0, ex:"Sie räumt ein, dass „proves“ zu stark formuliert war."}
